237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 195 0 R
/E (Aid is a narrative that feels intuitive. How could a word that means help or assistance be negative for the recipient, or anything other than virtuous for the donor? A deeper insight into global economic systems makes one thing increasingly clear: aid and development are neither neutral nor apolitical. As you will soon discuss, the very democratic structure of the state relies on its independence from foreign economic mercy. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
