<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 195 0 R
/E (Quite like aid, this committee will not be neutral, and regardless of intention, it will not be apolitical. I promise to serve this committee with the commitment and dedication it deserves, and I hope to spark your interest in Economics. I look forward to engaging with every one of you.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
