/P 207 0 R
/E (Another important part of this modern strategy is domestic resource mobilization \(DRM\). The World Bank aims to help developing countries improve their own taxation systems. Currently, many developing nations do not have efficient tax collection systems, neither from citizens nor businesses. By helping these countries build fair and transparent tax offices, the Bank ensures that governments can eventually fund their own budgets. The goal is for countries to stop relying on external aid and instead use their own national income. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
