/P 208 0 R
/E (Foreign aid, within this context, is categorized into two main distinctions: bilateral and multilateral. This categorization is based on the administrative sequence \(and therefore, the underlying objectives of the donor\). )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
